        "name": "Legendary Tales: Map of Hope Collector's Edition",
        "steam_appid": 3801470,
        "required_age": 0,
        "is_free": false,
        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the path no one would walk. Believe in what was lost. Some truths are buried where only the high-hearted dare step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Legendary Tales: Map of Hope” is an adventure game in the Hidden Objects genre, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters, and complicated quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucia and her brother have spent years running and hiding from witches, with nowhere left to turn. But their old friend Skarlett brings news that dispels the looming despair: there may be a place where they can finally reunite with their own kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, Skarlett cannot join the journey. The risk of exposing herself among the witches is far too great. Lucia must walk this path alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, as ever, she and her brother won’t be truly alone. Along the way, they’ll find allies—some familiar, some unexpected—each helping them inch closer to that distant dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they finally find peace among their kindred?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prove that the legends are true</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the magic world and its forgotten secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gather fascinating collections and find dozens of morphing objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy stunning locations and beautiful soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve dozens of puzzles and test your skills in exciting mini-games</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face the path no one would walk. Believe in what was lost. Some truths are buried where only the high-hearted dare step.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >“Legendary Tales: Map of Hope” is an adventure game in the Hidden Objects genre, with plenty of mini-games and puzzles, unforgettable characters, and complicated quests.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucia and her brother have spent years running and hiding from witches, with nowhere left to turn. But their old friend Skarlett brings news that dispels the looming despair: there may be a place where they can finally reunite with their own kind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unfortunately, Skarlett cannot join the journey. The risk of exposing herself among the witches is far too great. Lucia must walk this path alone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Still, as ever, she and her brother won’t be truly alone. Along the way, they’ll find allies—some familiar, some unexpected—each helping them inch closer to that distant dream.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Will they finally find peace among their kindred?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Prove that the legends are true</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Explore the magic world and its forgotten secrets</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Gather fascinating collections and find dozens of morphing objects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Enjoy stunning locations and beautiful soundtracks</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Solve dozens of puzzles and test your skills in exciting mini-games</p>",
